OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FWindy and
OL,6,Fcloudy. Rain extending from Argyll
OL,7,Facross the whole area during the
OL,8,Fevening, perhaps turning heavy at
OL,9,Ftimes and to snow over Argyll hills
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FCloud, rain, hill snow
OL,13,Finitially, erratically clearing as
OL,14,Fsunshine and showers follow from the
OL,15,Fnorthwest through the day, with these
OL,16,Flater outbreaks focused over the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
